{
  "187.csv::355": {
    "id": "187.csv::355",
    "source_text": "&quot;シェドレアン大神殿&quot;での問題を\n解決してくれたみたいね！\nアデルドナハからも、礼をいっておいてくれと\n言われたよ――",
    "translated_text": "Seems you&#x27;ve resolved the matter at the &quot;Shadolean Great Temple&quot;! Adair Donnchadh bade me convey his thanks—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T22:16:02.958223",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-21T20:58:10.814027",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 355,
    "speaker": "Deryn",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::356": {
    "id": "187.csv::356",
    "source_text": "今は戦果の分析中だから\nもうしばらく待っていてちょうだい",
    "translated_text": "I analyze the battle&#x27;s yield even now. You&#x27;ll wait a while longer.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T22:16:17.000161",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-21T20:58:33.694835",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 356,
    "speaker": "Deryn",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::357": {
    "id": "187.csv::357",
    "source_text": "今回のミッションでは物凄いはたらきを\nしてくれたみたいね！",
    "translated_text": "It seems you&#x27;ve done prodigious work this Mission!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T22:16:37.428456",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-21T20:59:12.276360",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 357,
    "speaker": "Deryn",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::358": {
    "id": "187.csv::358",
    "source_text": "戦果の報酬として、シークレットアビリティが\n付与されるよ\n受け取ってちょうだい",
    "translated_text": "A Secret Augment is bestowed as reward for your deeds. Accept it.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T22:16:45.982420",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-21T20:59:24.781083",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 358,
    "speaker": "Deryn",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::327": {
    "id": "187.csv::327",
    "source_text": "何とか退けることができたようだな\nさすがだ、覚者よ",
    "translated_text": "It seems you have managed to repel them. As expected, Arisen.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T22:27:40.680955",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T22:27:40.686319",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 327,
    "speaker": "Cornelia",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::328": {
    "id": "187.csv::328",
    "source_text": "戦果を集計しているところだ\n報酬支給はもう少し時間をくれ",
    "translated_text": "I am tallying the battle results. Grant a little more time for the reward payment.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T22:27:47.683184",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T22:27:47.686963",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 328,
    "speaker": "Cornelia",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::329": {
    "id": "187.csv::329",
    "source_text": "ただいま魔物と交戦した方々の戦果を\n集計しています",
    "translated_text": "I&#x27;m tallying the battle gains of those who fought monsters even now.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T22:28:07.470444",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T22:28:07.473435",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 329,
    "speaker": "Seneka",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::330": {
    "id": "187.csv::330",
    "source_text": "発表まで今しばらくお待ちください",
    "translated_text": "Pray wait awhile longer for the announcement.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T22:28:16.642271",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T22:28:16.645370",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 330,
    "speaker": "Seneka",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::74": {
    "id": "187.csv::74",
    "source_text": "オラオラオラオラ！",
    "translated_text": "Hah! Hah! Hah! Hah!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T23:05:49.258555",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T23:05:49.261824",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 74,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::75": {
    "id": "187.csv::75",
    "source_text": "こっちは任せろ！",
    "translated_text": "Leave this to me!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T23:05:55.943708",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T23:05:55.947355",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 75,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::76": {
    "id": "187.csv::76",
    "source_text": "ぶちかましてやるぜ！",
    "translated_text": "I&#x27;ll smash the lot of &#x27;em!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T23:06:07.306032",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T23:06:07.309945",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 76,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::77": {
    "id": "187.csv::77",
    "source_text": "おーし、おっぱじめるか！",
    "translated_text": "Right, let&#x27;s get cracking!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T23:06:24.351309",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T23:06:24.355700",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 77,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::78": {
    "id": "187.csv::78",
    "source_text": "よくやった、良い根性だ！",
    "translated_text": "Hah! Well done, good willpower!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T23:06:40.100575",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T23:06:40.103874",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 78,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::79": {
    "id": "187.csv::79",
    "source_text": "ちゃっちゃと終わらせるぞ",
    "translated_text": "Let&#x27;s wrap this up quick.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T23:06:50.753213",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T23:06:50.756760",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 79,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::80": {
    "id": "187.csv::80",
    "source_text": "こいつぁ嬉しくなってくるね",
    "translated_text": "This is gettin&#x27; right pleasant, eh.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T23:07:07.366351",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T23:07:07.370204",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 80,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::81": {
    "id": "187.csv::81",
    "source_text": "血わき肉躍るとはこのことだ！",
    "translated_text": "This is what blood afire and flesh leaping means!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T23:07:35.262695",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T23:07:35.266620",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 81,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::82": {
    "id": "187.csv::82",
    "source_text": "敵に舐められたら終いだぞ",
    "translated_text": "Let the enemy make light of you, and it&#x27;s over.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T23:07:55.807244",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T23:07:55.810977",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 82,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::83": {
    "id": "187.csv::83",
    "source_text": "アアアア！",
    "translated_text": "Gaaah!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T23:08:03.111044",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T23:08:03.114824",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 83,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::84": {
    "id": "187.csv::84",
    "source_text": "ま、こんなもんだろ",
    "translated_text": "Right, that&#x27;s the lot of it, eh?",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T23:08:16.988202",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T23:08:16.992004",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 84,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::85": {
    "id": "187.csv::85",
    "source_text": "森の中ほどとはいかないけれど――",
    "translated_text": "&#x27;Tis not quite the forest&#x27;s midst, yet—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T23:08:27.732368",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T23:08:27.737996",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 85,
    "speaker": "Kieshildt",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::86": {
    "id": "187.csv::86",
    "source_text": "造作ない――",
    "translated_text": "&#x27;Tis no great matter—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T23:08:39.364721",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T23:08:39.368707",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 86,
    "speaker": "Kieshildt",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::87": {
    "id": "187.csv::87",
    "source_text": "気をつけて――",
    "translated_text": "Take heed...",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T23:08:43.143018",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T23:08:43.147112",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 87,
    "speaker": "Kieshildt",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::88": {
    "id": "187.csv::88",
    "source_text": "まだ倒れてもらっては困る\n――手を貸そう",
    "translated_text": "&#x27;Twould not do for you to fall just yet... Let me lend a hand.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T23:09:21.585271",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T23:09:21.590320",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 88,
    "speaker": "Kieshildt",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::89": {
    "id": "187.csv::89",
    "source_text": "ここはもう大丈夫だ――",
    "translated_text": "&#x27;Tis safe here now—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T23:09:30.078659",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T23:09:30.082890",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 89,
    "speaker": "Kieshildt",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::90": {
    "id": "187.csv::90",
    "source_text": "よし、次だ",
    "translated_text": "Good. The next.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T23:09:54.505711",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T23:09:54.510656",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 90,
    "speaker": "Kieshildt",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::91": {
    "id": "187.csv::91",
    "source_text": "うん？――招かざる客の登場だ",
    "translated_text": "Hm? — An unbidden guest appears.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T23:10:29.858770",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T23:10:29.864089",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 91,
    "speaker": "Kieshildt",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::92": {
    "id": "187.csv::92",
    "source_text": "逢瀬の誘いのようだけど\n次の機会に――とはいかなさそうだね",
    "translated_text": "&#x27;Tis like a tryst&#x27;s invitation, but next time— &#x27;twill not serve.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T23:10:41.627223",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T23:10:41.633386",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 92,
    "speaker": "Kieshildt",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::93": {
    "id": "187.csv::93",
    "source_text": "こいつは僕が引きつけよう",
    "translated_text": "I shall lure this one",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T23:12:21.118984",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T23:12:21.124193",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 93,
    "speaker": "Kieshildt",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::94": {
    "id": "187.csv::94",
    "source_text": "この命、簡単には渡せないな",
    "translated_text": "This life, &#x27;tis not yielded so lightly.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T23:12:32.127395",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T23:12:32.132642",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 94,
    "speaker": "Kieshildt",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::95": {
    "id": "187.csv::95",
    "source_text": "覚者さんたち――やるね",
    "translated_text": "Ser Arisen— &#x27;tis well done.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T23:12:47.799867",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T23:12:47.804668",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 95,
    "speaker": "Kieshildt",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::96": {
    "id": "187.csv::96",
    "source_text": "覚者の命、全て狩り取ってくれるわ",
    "translated_text": "I shall hunt down every Arisen life.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T23:13:11.843079",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T23:13:11.848341",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 96,
    "speaker": "Mogok",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::97": {
    "id": "187.csv::97",
    "source_text": "覚者の命は値千金！　奪え！",
    "translated_text": "The Arisen&#x27;s life is worth a king&#x27;s ransom! Seize it!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T23:13:18.463231",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T23:13:18.469382",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 97,
    "speaker": "Mogok",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::98": {
    "id": "187.csv::98",
    "source_text": "今日はここまでだ",
    "translated_text": "That is all for today.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T23:13:27.358926",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T23:13:27.364714",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 98,
    "speaker": "Mogok",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "187.csv::99": {
    "id": "187.csv::99",
    "source_text": "まさか――この――俺が――",
    "translated_text": "Impossible... this... I...",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T23:13:44.432861",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T23:13:44.439059",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\187.csv",
    "row_index": 99,
    "speaker": "Mogok",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  }
}